<item>
            <title>[DIGIX-65388] [BBD]  Strategic Shop the Look</title>
                <link>https://team-1626860771808.atlassian.net/browse/DIGIX-65388</link>
                <project id="10043" key="DIGIX">Digital Product Team</project>
                    <description>&lt;!-- ADF macro (type = &apos;table&apos;) --&gt;

&lt;div class=&apos;table-wrap&apos;&gt;
&lt;table class=&apos;confluenceTable&apos;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EPIC Label&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EPIC description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&#8216;Shop the Look&#8217; will allow users to discover and purchase/stock check every product that we sell within a given product image on the PDP&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Benefit Hypothesis &amp;amp; Success metrics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;Increasing ATV is a key business objective for 25/26. By providing customers with a means to easily add further products to their purchase at the PDP of related items to what they are viewing on that PDP that the customer will add further products to basket therefore increasing transaction value. This was proven via a previous STL AB Test.
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Completion of DSD and KDD&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Technical Approach outlined (API, Widget, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;By deploying STL:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Higher ATV &amp;amp; UPT&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Increased add to bag&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scope &amp;amp; List of Requirements&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Objective:&lt;/b&gt; &#8220;Shop the Look&#8221; with Story Stream that allows customers to easily view and purchase all items in an outfit directly from a single image. This feature should integrate with the existing e-commerce platform, providing a smooth and intuitive shopping experience.&lt;br/&gt;
Required:
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Consider current requirements of Shop the Look
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Limit to Model Shots&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Allow limiting as required for certain categories and sub categories&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Allow limiting as required to click and collect if required&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Design of Shop the Look Technical implementation (DSD/KDD)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Consider Shop Set restriction (do not show shop the look if shop set is present) NB: Future requirement would be to replace Shop Set with Shop the Look for many items (some flexibility needed for manually curated sets (i.e. homeware, Christmas fam jams)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Consider functionality (possibly phased) for getting to a PDP (as current) and also adding an &#8216;Add to Cart&#8217; function (which may be ab tested) -NB: will want outcome of Add to Cart on PLP AB Test&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Consider Test approach with &#8216;live data&#8217;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Consider best way to incorporate Google Analytics to track customer behaviour and purchase measures&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Consider Shop the Look utilisation on &#8216;any&#8217; model shot page (Flexibility to allow on any model shot image or even carousel image)?&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Open Question: Do we develop for UK Only (second version with no add to cart possibility?)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;All devices&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;UX design may be needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risks, Constraints, Assumptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;API integration with Story Stream&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Story Stream Widget&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;UX for design of Shop the Look functionality&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Model Shots only &amp;amp; Flexibility of categories&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Datalayer events needed&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Accessibility&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Future AB Test of Add to cart functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;NFR&#8217;s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;Performance should not be impacted&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dependencies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;UX for design&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Story Stream&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Analytics team for metrics definition&lt;br/&gt;
*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
