&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://team-1626860771808.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DIGIX/pages/1519485099/KDD+002.01+-+Style+it+with&quot; title=&quot;smart-link&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;https://team-1626860771808.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DIGIX/pages/1519485099/KDD+002.01+-+Style+it+with&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;br/&gt;
